=2 Walkthrough
* While the quest {q:Ode to the Serpents|Ode to the Serpents|Ode to the Serpents} is active, speak to {n:Gaweesh} in {z:Al Zahbi} (G-8).
* In {z:Wajaom Woodlands} kill {m:Aht Urhgan Attercops|Aht Urhgan Attercop} (Spiders) until you get a {i:Frayed Arrow|Frayed Arrow|2462}.
* Go to Giwahb Watchtower in Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) and trade the Frayed Arrow to the door for a cutscene that completes the quest.
** Three {m:Aht Urhgan Attercops|Aht Urhgan Attercop} are located at the Watchtower.
** Additional {m:Aht Urhgan Attercops|Aht Urhgan Attercop} can be found at (F-6) and (E-8)

You may only get the cutscenes when {n:General Najelith|Najelith} is in Al Zahbi.
The fastest Travel path is to take the Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide Teleport. The long way is the exit from the G-10 Aht Urhgan Whitegate exit.
